Description: lh-ota - Threshold Ed25519 Quorum & Monotonic SVN Anti-Rollback
 Zero-dependency Go atomic dual A/B partition Over-The-Air (OTA) firmware updater with M-of-N threshold Ed25519 signature verification, streaming chunk SHA-256 checks, watchdog boot-trial rollback, and SVN ratcheting.
